763	 * "backing". A person belongs to one sheet (null for the unnamed sheet) and is numbered within it, so sheets never share people. "Net" is momentum plus backing (backing counted as zero without patrons). A person may have a
764	 * "grade" (LOW, MID or HIGH; absent until given), from which their "weight" is 1, 3 or 5. "Load" is momentum times weight.
