769	 * patrons' effective, rounded down (zero without patrons). "Influence" is effective plus clout. "Brace" is influence plus two times force. "Tide" is the brace of the people followed added together, each followed brace taken as their momentum plus two times force and only positive braces counted (zero without any). "Strain" is crest minus brace. "Pulse" classifies strain against a tolerance band of 10 either side of zero.
