78:// combined is "n/a").
79:// Their band classifies their adjusted: E below 0, D from 0 to 99, C from 100 to 249, B from 250 to 499 and
80:// A from 500 ("n/a" while adjusted is "n/a").
81:// Their scaled is their adjusted times their band's multiplier: A 4, B 3, C 2, D 1, E 0 ("n/a" while
82:// adjusted is "n/a").
